    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More than just handball!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget regular sports games! CabbageBall throws magical abilities into the mix, letting you unleash devastating spells, conjure strategic buffs, and pull off game-changing combos. Think teleporting to the air to steal goals or summoning a mystical vine to capture your opponents. Every match is an epic battle of skill-based game and strategy, where quick reflexes reign supreme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532110/extras/fc9ccf7cb56deb7ad2b3fd3b3f30546c.poster.avif?t=1742344026\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532110/extras/fc9ccf7cb56deb7ad2b3fd3b3f30546c.webm?t=1742344026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532110/extras/fc9ccf7cb56deb7ad2b3fd3b3f30546c.mp4?t=1742344026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team Up for the Win</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up in intense 2v2 and 3v3 battles where teamwork is the key to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can strategize your plays and coordinate devastating spell combos to leave your opponents in the dust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to high-five your teammates as you pull off the play of the day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532110/extras/80832d557153de0c378340c644988e9a.poster.avif?t=1742344026\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532110/extras/80832d557153de0c378340c644988e9a.webm?t=1742344026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532110/extras/80832d557153de0c378340c644988e9a.mp4?t=1742344026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ever Expanding Roster Of Heroes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select your hero from a diverse lineup of mystical heroes, each blessed with extraordinary powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532110/extras/faf7809f446ce3267e2331f0f2ae4488.poster.avif?t=1742344026\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532110/extras/faf7809f446ce3267e2331f0f2ae4488.webm?t=1742344026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532110/extras/faf7809f446ce3267e2331f0f2ae4488.mp4?t=1742344026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Game Is the Same</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a seasoned esports veteran or a casual couch warrior, CabbageBall offers an exhilarating experience that keeps you coming back for more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532110/extras/7de60f8a7acc5b962c9738d08b030d47.poster.avif?t=1742344026\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532110/extras/7de60f8a7acc5b962c9738d08b030d47.webm?t=1742344026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532110/extras/7de60f8a7acc5b962c9738d08b030d47.mp4?t=1742344026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More than just handball!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget regular sports games! CabbageBall throws magical abilities into the mix, letting you unleash devastating spells, conjure strategic buffs, and pull off game-changing combos. Think teleporting to the air to steal goals or summoning a mystical vine to capture your opponents. Every match is an epic battle of skill-based game and strategy, where quick reflexes reign supreme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532110/extras/fc9ccf7cb56deb7ad2b3fd3b3f30546c.poster.avif?t=1742344026\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532110/extras/fc9ccf7cb56deb7ad2b3fd3b3f30546c.webm?t=1742344026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532110/extras/fc9ccf7cb56deb7ad2b3fd3b3f30546c.mp4?t=1742344026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team Up for the Win</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up in intense 2v2 and 3v3 battles where teamwork is the key to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can strategize your plays and coordinate devastating spell combos to leave your opponents in the dust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to high-five your teammates as you pull off the play of the day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532110/extras/80832d557153de0c378340c644988e9a.poster.avif?t=1742344026\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532110/extras/80832d557153de0c378340c644988e9a.webm?t=1742344026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532110/extras/80832d557153de0c378340c644988e9a.mp4?t=1742344026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ever Expanding Roster Of Heroes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select your hero from a diverse lineup of mystical heroes, each blessed with extraordinary powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532110/extras/faf7809f446ce3267e2331f0f2ae4488.poster.avif?t=1742344026\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532110/extras/faf7809f446ce3267e2331f0f2ae4488.webm?t=1742344026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532110/extras/faf7809f446ce3267e2331f0f2ae4488.mp4?t=1742344026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Game Is the Same</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a seasoned esports veteran or a casual couch warrior, CabbageBall offers an exhilarating experience that keeps you coming back for more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532110/extras/7de60f8a7acc5b962c9738d08b030d47.poster.avif?t=1742344026\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532110/extras/7de60f8a7acc5b962c9738d08b030d47.webm?t=1742344026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532110/extras/7de60f8a7acc5b962c9738d08b030d47.mp4?t=1742344026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
